planation":"10 - 2 = 8，8 分成两个相同的数是 4 和 4，所以□是 4。","verify":"(10-2)/2"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q1","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"10 可以分成 6 和几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"4","explanation":"6+4=10，所以 10 可以分成 6 和 4。","verify":"10-6"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q2","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"7 和 3 合起来是几？","englishAudio":null,"options":["9","10","11"],"answer":"10","explanation":"7+3=10，所以 7 和 3 合起来是 10。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q3","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"9 颗糖分给妹妹 4 颗，再分给弟弟 2 颗，还剩几颗？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"3","explanation":"9 - 4 - 2 = 3。","verify":"9-4-2=3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q4","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"妈妈买了 10 个鸡蛋，吃了 2 个，又吃了 3 个，还剩几个？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"5","explanation":"吃了两次，要减两次：10-2-3=5，还剩 5 个。","verify":"10-2-3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q5","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"10 可以分成 6 和几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"4","explanation":"10 - 6 = 4。","verify":"10-6=4"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q6","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪两个数合起来是 10？","englishAudio":null,"options":["3和6","8和2","5和4"],"answer":"8和2","explanation":"3+6=9，8+2=10，5+4=9，只有 8 和 2 合起来是 10。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q7","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"hard","type":"numeric","prompt":"盘里有 10 颗糖，吃掉 6 颗，又吃掉 1 颗，还剩几颗？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"3","explanation":"10 - 6 - 1 = 3。","verify":"10-6-1=3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q8","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"8 和 2 合起来是 10，那么 10 可以分成 8 和几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"2","explanation":"8 和 2 合起来是 10，反过来 10 就可以分成 8 和 2。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6_q9","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l6","difficulty":"hard","type":"numeric","promp