on":"多 3 支就是 7 + 3 = 10 支。","verify":"7+3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l7_q9","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l7","difficulty":"hard","type":"numeric","prompt":"小明有 5 颗糖，小红比小明多 2 颗，小刚比小红少 1 颗，三人一共几颗？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"18","explanation":"小红有 5 + 2 = 7 颗，小刚有 7 - 1 = 6 颗，三人一共 5 + 7 + 6 = 18 颗。","verify":"5+7+6"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q1","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"3 ○ 5，○里填什么符号？","englishAudio":null,"options":["<",">","="],"answer":"<","explanation":"3 比 5 小，所以填小于号 <。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q2","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"4 < □，□里最小填几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"5","explanation":"比 4 大的数中最小的是 5，所以□里最小填 5。","verify":"4+1"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q3","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个说法是对的？","englishAudio":null,"options":["6 > 7","8 = 8","5 < 4"],"answer":"8 = 8","explanation":"6 比 7 小，5 比 4 大，只有 8 和 8 一样大是对的。容易错的是把符号方向看反。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q4","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"5+2 ○ 8，○里填什么符号？","englishAudio":null,"options":["<",">","="],"answer":"<","explanation":"先算 5+2=7，7 比 8 小，所以填小于号 <。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q5","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个式子是错的？","englishAudio":null,"options":["4>3","2<2","6=6"],"answer":"2<2","explanation":"4 比 3 大是对的，6 和 6 一样大是对的；2 和 2 一样大，应该填 =，不是 <，所以 2<2 是错的。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q6","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"“9 比 5 大，5 比 9 小”这句话对吗？（填对或错）","englishAudio":null,"options":["对","错"],"answer":"对","explanation":"9 比 5 大是对的，反过来说 5 比 9 小也是对的。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q7","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"hard","type":"choice","prompt":"□ > 6，□里可以填几？","englishAudio":null,"options":["5","6","9"],"answer":"9","explanation":"□ 要比 6 大，5 比 6 小，6 和 6 一样大，只有 9 比 6 大。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q8","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"6 ○ 6，○里填什么符号？","englishAudio":null,"options":["=",">","<"],"answer":"=","explanation":"两边都是 6，一样大，所以填等于号。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8_q9","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l8","difficulty":"hard","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个式子是对的？","englishAudio":null,"options":["7<7","9>10","6+2=8"],"answer":"6+2=8","explanation":"7 < 7 是错的，两边相等不能填小于；9 > 10 是错的，9 比 10 小；6 + 2 = 8 是对的。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q1","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"一排小动物，从左数小兔排第 2，小兔前面有几只小动物？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"1","explanation":"排第 2，前面只有排第 1 的 1 只小动物。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q2","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"从右往左数，小猫排第 4；从左往右数，小猫排第 2。这一排一共有几只小动物？","englishAudio":null,"options":["4","5","6"],"answer":"5","explanation":"4+2-1=5，因为小猫自己被算了两次，要减去 1 次。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q3","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"hard","type":"numeric","prompt":"小朋友排队，小明前面有 3 人，后面有 4 人，这一排一共有几人？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"8","explanation":"前面 3 人 + 小明自己 1 人 + 后面 4 人 = 8 人。容易错的是忘了算小明自己。","verify":"3+1+4"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q4","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"小明前面有 3 人，后面有 3 人，小明排第几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"4","explanation":"前面有 3 人，小明就是第 4 个。容易错的是把小明自己也算进前面的人里。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q5","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"一排 10 只小动物，从左数小猫排第 3，从右数小猫排第几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"8","explanation":"一共 10 只，从左数第 3 只，从右数就是 10-3+1=8，第 8 只。容易错的是忘了加小猫自己，算成 7。","verify":"10-3+1"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q6","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"小明排第 2，小红排第 5，小明和小红之间有几人？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"2","explanation":"从第 2 到第 5，中间隔着第 3、第 4，5-2-1=2，有 2 人。","verify":"5-2-1"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q7","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"hard","type":"numeric","prompt":"一排 10 个小朋友，从左数小刚排第 3，从右数小红排第 2，他们之间有几人？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"5","explanation":"小红从左数是 10-2+1=9，第 3 和第 9 之间有 9-3-1=5 人。","verify":"10-2+1-3-1"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q8","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"从右数小红排第 3，从左数小红排第 6，这一排一共有几人？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"8","explanation":"从右数第 3 说明右边有 2 人，从左数第 6 说明左边有 5 人，加上小红自己，一共 2 + 5 + 1 = 8 人。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9_q9","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u3_l9","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"小刚排第 3，小丽排第 7，两人之间有几人？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"3","explanation":"第4、第5、第6，共 3 人。","verify":"7-3-1=3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1_q1","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"2 + 3 = ？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"5","explanation":"2 再添 3 就是 5。","verify":"2+3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1_q2","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"小明上午看了 4 页书，下午看了 3 页，一共看了几页？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"7","explanation":"上午和下午看的加起来：4+3=7 页。","verify":"4+3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1_q3","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"□ + 5 = 9，□里填几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"4","explanation":"想 9 的分成：9 可以分成 4 和 5，所以□里填 4。","verify":"9-5"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1_q4","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"树上有 5 只鸟，飞来 4 只，又飞走 2 只，现在有几只？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"7","explanation":"飞来要加，飞走要减：5+4-2=7，现在有 7 只。","verify":"5+4-2"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1_q5","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"□ + 3 = 8，□里填几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"5","explanation":"8 - 3 = 5。","verify":"5+3=8"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1_q6","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l1","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"小明上午做了 3 道题，下午做了 4 道题，晚上又做了 2 道题，一共做了几道题？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"9","expl