icId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个算式的结果最大？","englishAudio":null,"options":["5+2-1","9-4+1","3+3+3"],"answer":"3+3+3","explanation":"分别算出 5+2-1=6，9-4+1=6，3+3+3=9，最大的是 3+3+3。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8_q4","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"medium","type":"numeric","prompt":"花园里有 6 只蝴蝶，飞来 3 只，又飞走 4 只，现在有几只？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"5","explanation":"飞来要加，飞走要减：6+3-4=5，现在有 5 只。","verify":"6+3-4"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8_q5","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个算式的结果最小？","englishAudio":null,"options":["8-2+1","4+4-2","9-3-1"],"answer":"9-3-1","explanation":"分别算出 8-2+1=7，4+4-2=6，9-3-1=5，最小的是 9-3-1。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8_q6","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"下面哪个算式的结果是 9？","englishAudio":null,"options":["6+2-1","8-2+3","4+4-2"],"answer":"8-2+3","explanation":"6+2-1=7，8-2+3=9，4+4-2=6，只有 8-2+3 的结果是 9。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8_q7","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"hard","type":"numeric","prompt":"小朋友跳绳，第一组跳了 7 下，第二组比第一组多跳 2 下，第三组比第二组少跳 3 下，第三组跳了几下？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"6","explanation":"第二组跳 7+2=9 下，第三组跳 9-3=6 下。","verify":"7+2-3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8_q8","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"5 + 2 - 3 = ？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"4","explanation":"先算 5 + 2 = 7，再算 7 - 3 = 4。","verify":"5+2-3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8_q9","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u4_l8","difficulty":"hard","type":"choice","prompt":"下面三个算式中，得数最小的是哪一个？","englishAudio":null,"options":["7+2-1","10-4+2","6+3-2"],"answer":"6+3-2","explanation":"7 + 2 - 1 = 8，10 - 4 + 2 = 8，6 + 3 - 2 = 7，最小的是 6 + 3 - 2。","verify":""},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u5_l1_q1","topicId":"hjm_g1a_u5_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"1 个十和 3 个一合起来是几？","englishAudio":null,"options":[],"answer":"13","explanation":"1 个十是 10，再加 3 个一，就是 13。","verify":"10+3"},{"id":"hjm_g1a_u5_l1_q2","topicId":"hjm_