ook. 是“打开书”，上课要跟着老师做。","verify":""},{"id":"hje_g1a_u0_l1_q5","topicId":"hje_g1a_u0_l1","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"🧍 老师说“Stand up.”（起立），小朋友应该怎么做？","englishAudio":"Stand up.","options":["站起来","坐下","趴在桌上"],"answer":"站起来","explanation":"Stand up. 是“起立”，上课开始时常听到。","verify":""},{"id":"hje_g1a_u0_l1_q6","topicId":"hje_g1a_u0_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"🎧 听一听课堂指令：Listen!，小朋友应该？","englishAudio":"Listen!","options":["认真听","闭上眼睛","跑出教室"],"answer":"认真听","explanation":"Listen! 是“认真听”的意思。","verify":"Listen!"},{"id":"hje_g1a_u0_l1_q7","topicId":"hje_g1a_u0_l1","difficulty":"hard","type":"choice","prompt":"🎧 老师说“Listen and repeat.”（听并跟读），小朋友应该怎么做？","englishAudio":"Listen and repeat.","options":["先认真听，再跟着读","只读不听","只听不读"],"answer":"先认真听，再跟着读","explanation":"Listen and repeat. 是先听再跟读，两个步骤都要做。","verify":""},{"id":"hje_g1a_u0_l1_q8","topicId":"hje_g1a_u0_l1","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"✅ 课堂上，老师问大家“Are you ready?”（你们准备好了吗？），准备好的小朋友可以回答？","englishAudio":"Yes!","options":["Yes!","No!","Goodbye!"],"answer":"Yes!","explanation":"准备好了回答 Yes!，没准备好才说 No。","verify":""},{"id":"hje_g1a_u0_l1_q9","topicId":"hje_g1a_u0_l1","difficulty":"medium","type":"choice","prompt":"🙇 老师帮你拿书时，你可以礼貌地说？","englishAudio":"Thank you!","options":["Thank you!","Goodbye!","Stand up!"],"answer":"Thank you!","explanation":"得到帮助要说 Thank you!。","verify":"Thank you!"},{"id":"hje_g1a_u1_l1_q1","topicId":"hje_g1a_u1_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"🌅 “早上”的英语单词是？","englishAudio":"morning","options":["morning","afternoon","evening"],"answer":"morning","explanation":"morning 是早上，afternoon 是下午，evening 是晚上。","verify":""},{"id":"hje_g1a_u1_l1_q2","topicId":"hje_g1a_u1_l1","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"☀️ 下午见到同学，应该说？","englishAudio":"Good afternoon!","options":["Good afternoon!","Good morning!","Good evening!"],"answer":"Good afternoon!","explanation":"下午用 afternoon，问候语是 Good afternoon。","verify":""},{"id":"hje_g1a_u1_l1_q3","topicId":